(5570186, 806880, 49109, '<td valign="top">not quite what I expected to see here, but surely meeting challenge. nice vibrant colors and interesting use of DOF. The centered composition and the skewed perspective detract quite a bit.</td>', 'not quite what I expected to see here, but surely meeting challenge. nice vibrant colors and interesting use of DOF. The centered composition and the skewed perspective detract quite a bit.', '2009-07-13 07:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
