(5570201, 806733, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good composition and lighting, I like how the gerber seems to bend towards the light on the background. Unfortunately the stem lost its natural color, could have been brought back in processing. This fact, the amount of sharpening artefacts (on the stem and in the bg) and the slight blur of the orange border lower my vote to 7.</td>', 'very good composition and lighting, I like how the gerber seems to bend towards the light on the background. Unfortunately the stem lost its natural color, could have been brought back in processing. This fact, the amount of sharpening artefacts (on the stem and in the bg) and the slight blur of the orange border lower my vote to 7.', '2009-07-13 07:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5570203, 806905, 49109, '<td valign="top">unusual idea, pleasing to the eye, but doesn''t really make sense to me. very good lighting and perfectly natural color. had not cropped the petals at top, though.</td>', 'unusual idea, pleasing to the eye, but doesn''t really make sense to me. very good lighting and perfectly natural color. had not cropped the petals at top, though.', '2009-07-13 07:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
