(5570651, 806813, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the filled frame, seems a bit fuzzy and soft, almost like a painting.</td>', 'I like the filled frame, seems a bit fuzzy and soft, almost like a painting.', '2009-07-13 11:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
