(5570681, 806860, 87808, '<td valign="top">I love this, as soon as I saw it , a calming affect came over me.  The pale blues and creams are excellent.  I love the placement adn the stripes add so much to the shot.  I could see this in a shop selling.  Very well done 9</td>', 'I love this, as soon as I saw it , a calming affect came over me.  The pale blues and creams are excellent.  I love the placement adn the stripes add so much to the shot.  I could see this in a shop selling.  Very well done 9', '2009-07-13 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5570687, 806193, 43774, '<td valign="top">A bit too faded for me, although it would make a great background for something like a wedding invitation.</td>', 'A bit too faded for me, although it would make a great background for something like a wedding invitation.', '2009-07-13 12:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5570690, 806736, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and colour. Photo is a bit small for this challenge, you can go to 720 pixels wide.</td>', 'Great clarity and colour. Photo is a bit small for this challenge, you can go to 720 pixels wide.', '2009-07-13 12:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5570691, 806174, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like that vase. Nice flowers, but I can see your editing.....background erased? You missed some areas on the lower right. Wish the bottom of the vase wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'I like that vase. Nice flowers, but I can see your editing.....background erased? You missed some areas on the lower right. Wish the bottom of the vase wasn''t cut off.', '2009-07-13 12:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
