(5570797, 806385, 43774, '<td valign="top">Painting with light or a filter added? Not that fond of it although it''s good that you tried somthing different and creative. I like the flowers, just not all the swirls behind them.</td>', 'Painting with light or a filter added? Not that fond of it although it''s good that you tried somthing different and creative. I like the flowers, just not all the swirls behind them.', '2009-07-13 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
