(5572343, 805966, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite one from this challenge. It''s unique and different. I love the layers and the glowing colour. You''ve captured a flower''s soul in your photo. Beautiful 10.</td>', 'This is my favourite one from this challenge. It''s unique and different. I love the layers and the glowing colour. You''ve captured a flower''s soul in your photo. Beautiful 10.', '2009-07-14 02:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572344, 806733, 10275, '<td valign="top">How very gorgeous this is. The background is so soft and the backlighting just soft enough to illuminate the delicate edges. Beautiful curve leads your eyes right in. 10</td>', 'How very gorgeous this is. The background is so soft and the backlighting just soft enough to illuminate the delicate edges. Beautiful curve leads your eyes right in. 10', '2009-07-14 03:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572346, 805522, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wow. You''ve captured a true 3D effect in your photo. It looks like an oil painting by some master painter. The light is so soft and yet you captured the details and sharpness so well. The stark black background makes the flower pop towards you. So very very beautiful! 10.</td>', 'Wow. You''ve captured a true 3D effect in your photo. It looks like an oil painting by some master painter. The light is so soft and yet you captured the details and sharpness so well. The stark black background makes the flower pop towards you. So very very beautiful! 10.', '2009-07-14 03:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572348, 805523, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely graphic representation of the subject. It''s so strong and bright, but very interesting to look at. A very unique style. I really like the white matt around the pattern. It gives it a breathing space. Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely graphic representation of the subject. It''s so strong and bright, but very interesting to look at. A very unique style. I really like the white matt around the pattern. It gives it a breathing space. Nicely done.', '2009-07-14 03:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572349, 806193, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful style of photography. Pastel essence of a flower. Magazine quality photo. I can see this in an ad for some delicate herbal lotion or a special fragrance mist. Very "sellable" photo.</td>', 'Beautiful style of photography. Pastel essence of a flower. Magazine quality photo. I can see this in an ad for some delicate herbal lotion or a special fragrance mist. Very "sellable" photo.', '2009-07-14 03:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572351, 806817, 10275, '<td valign="top">Wow, the glow is amazing. It looks like a volcano and lava flow. Almost too hot to touch. Great detail. Lovely photo. 9</td>', 'Wow, the glow is amazing. It looks like a volcano and lava flow. Almost too hot to touch. Great detail. Lovely photo. 9', '2009-07-14 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572353, 805010, 10275, '<td valign="top">You can almost smell the rain from this photo. Beautifully captured misty feeling. You''ve managed to keep the whites intact without overblowing them. Compositionally the image could be a bit longer on the bottom part to balance the whiteness of the top part. Still a beautiful to look at. 9</td>', 'You can almost smell the rain from this photo. Beautifully captured misty feeling. You''ve managed to keep the whites intact without overblowing them. Compositionally the image could be a bit longer on the bottom part to balance the whiteness of the top part. Still a beautiful to look at. 9', '2009-07-14 03:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572355, 806256, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and colour harmony.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and colour harmony.', '2009-07-14 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572358, 805297, 10275, '<td valign="top">wow, stunning capture. I know this has been done many times, but you''ve managed to find a nice angle and line of composition. the dark part in the left bottom corner is the only minor distraction.</td>', 'wow, stunning capture. I know this has been done many times, but you''ve managed to find a nice angle and line of composition. the dark part in the left bottom corner is the only minor distraction.', '2009-07-14 03:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572360, 806535, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very unique, almost painterly watercolour feeling. Gorgeous light. I would have liked a lighter border to preserve the delicacy of the flower. Without the border it''s a winner. 9</td>', 'Very unique, almost painterly watercolour feeling. Gorgeous light. I would have liked a lighter border to preserve the delicacy of the flower. Without the border it''s a winner. 9', '2009-07-14 03:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572361, 806610, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Nice soft colours and clean sharp lines.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Nice soft colours and clean sharp lines.', '2009-07-14 03:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572362, 806370, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture. Lovely soft colour. The bottom leaf looks like it doesn''t belong. Fun photo to look at.</td>', 'Very cool capture. Lovely soft colour. The bottom leaf looks like it doesn''t belong. Fun photo to look at.', '2009-07-14 03:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572363, 805751, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting impressionistic effect - nice burst. Pleasing colours. I am missing some softness on the bottom left part though to have a balance of the over all softness.</td>', 'Interesting impressionistic effect - nice burst. Pleasing colours. I am missing some softness on the bottom left part though to have a balance of the over all softness.', '2009-07-14 03:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572365, 805954, 10275, '<td valign="top">What a lovely colour combination. this might have looked stronger in a vertical format, without the left empty space. You were probably trying the off centre composition, but in this case a tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'What a lovely colour combination. this might have looked stronger in a vertical format, without the left empty space. You were probably trying the off centre composition, but in this case a tighter crop would have helped.', '2009-07-14 03:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572367, 806172, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glowing colours. Lovely soft background. Too bad the top flower is obstructed by the leaf - that''s the pinnacle of the shot.</td>', 'Beautiful glowing colours. Lovely soft background. Too bad the top flower is obstructed by the leaf - that''s the pinnacle of the shot.', '2009-07-14 03:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572368, 806748, 10275, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous shot. Feels like a colour pencil drawing or pastels. Beautiful detail and structure. The only thing, the black background makes it pop out, but also kills a bit of the elegant mood of the flower. Perhaps trying a dark blue or dark purple background or some pastel colour to keep the feel of the delicacy...</td>', 'What a gorgeous shot. Feels like a colour pencil drawing or pastels. Beautiful detail and structure. The only thing, the black background makes it pop out, but also kills a bit of the elegant mood of the flower. Perhaps trying a dark blue or dark purple background or some pastel colour to keep the feel of the delicacy...', '2009-07-14 03:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572369, 806585, 11078, '<td valign="top">very pretty I like the arrangment of this</td>', 'very pretty I like the arrangment of this', '2009-07-14 03:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572370, 806614, 11078, '<td valign="top">Simple but very effective</td>', 'Simple but very effective', '2009-07-14 03:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572371, 806724, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great still life with a beatiful soft light. Can''t fault this for anything. Painting-like image.</td>', 'Great still life with a beatiful soft light. Can''t fault this for anything. Painting-like image.', '2009-07-14 03:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572372, 806728, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very well done white on white shot. So soft and light. Nice composition, curves and lines.</td>', 'Very well done white on white shot. So soft and light. Nice composition, curves and lines.', '2009-07-14 03:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572373, 805314, 10275, '<td valign="top">Love the mood of this image. The grain is so well done (would have been OK with a bit on the flower as well). Looks like a watercolour painting with grains of sand added for a texture. Gorgeous!</td>', 'Love the mood of this image. The grain is so well done (would have been OK with a bit on the flower as well). Looks like a watercolour painting with grains of sand added for a texture. Gorgeous!', '2009-07-14 03:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572375, 806724, 11078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and lovely arrangment background just right <br/>I love this adding it to my favorites and giving it a 10</td>', 'Beautiful colours and lovely arrangment background just right I love this adding it to my favorites and giving it a 10', '2009-07-14 03:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572376, 805074, 11078, '<td valign="top">A nice perspective Very Pretty 8</td>', 'A nice perspective Very Pretty 8', '2009-07-14 03:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
