(5572378, 805999, 10275, '<td valign="top">High-end stock photography quality photo. Definitely worthy of a print. So clear and crisp.  I only wish the background wasn''t so black, but softer more subdued shade. The border is nice and not distracting, but could have been a different colour.</td>', 'High-end stock photography quality photo. Definitely worthy of a print. So clear and crisp.  I only wish the background wasn''t so black, but softer more subdued shade. The border is nice and not distracting, but could have been a different colour.', '2009-07-14 03:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572380, 806641, 11078, '<td valign="top">delicate and A very nice image 8</td>', 'delicate and A very nice image 8', '2009-07-14 03:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572381, 806414, 11078, '<td valign="top">A Very nice image 8</td>', 'A Very nice image 8', '2009-07-14 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572382, 806734, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like this it almost looks like a painting</td>', 'I like this it almost looks like a painting', '2009-07-14 03:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572383, 806864, 10275, '<td valign="top">wow, what a sharp, clear and bright image. So realistic, you can almost touch the fuzz. I like these flowers from behind (I know, sounds crazy). The black background is great, but the border could have been a bit thinner as to synchronize it with the delicacy of the fuzz.</td>', 'wow, what a sharp, clear and bright image. So realistic, you can almost touch the fuzz. I like these flowers from behind (I know, sounds crazy). The black background is great, but the border could have been a bit thinner as to synchronize it with the delicacy of the fuzz.', '2009-07-14 03:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572385, 805074, 10275, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective on this well known plant. Nice depth of field. Love the way it branches on and on. The greens and blues are very pleasing with nice sidelighting.</td>', 'Neat perspective on this well known plant. Nice depth of field. Love the way it branches on and on. The greens and blues are very pleasing with nice sidelighting.', '2009-07-14 03:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572386, 805955, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great, eye-popping colours. Nice shallow DOF. Good detail on the bee.</td>', 'Great, eye-popping colours. Nice shallow DOF. Good detail on the bee.', '2009-07-14 03:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572388, 806611, 11078, '<td valign="top">Stunning Macro focus Excellent</td>', 'Stunning Macro focus Excellent', '2009-07-14 03:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572389, 806641, 10275, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that the background is light (not black as so many other photos in this challenge). The translucency makes the shot. Beautiful.</td>', 'I love the fact that the background is light (not black as so many other photos in this challenge). The translucency makes the shot. Beautiful.', '2009-07-14 03:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5572392, 806682, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a beautiful photo, but you are right, it is way too Neon looking. The blue sort of killed the flower. It does not look natural, it almost looks plastic. Try to tone the blue down and you might have a good photo.</td>', 'Oh this is a beautiful photo, but you are right, it is way too Neon looking. The blue sort of killed the flower. It does not look natural, it almost looks plastic. Try to tone the blue down and you might have a good photo.', '2009-07-14 03:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
