(5572395, 805709, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is so intriguing. It looks like a miniature Hawaiian hoola dancer. So interesting to look at. The colours just pop at you.</td>', 'This is so intriguing. It looks like a miniature Hawaiian hoola dancer. So interesting to look at. The colours just pop at you.', '2009-07-14 03:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
