(5574926, 806539, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a killer nice rendering in B/W that lets me FEEL the colors fading.  Well done.<br/> <br/>I have finished my second pass, this is my only 10 thus far, though on average I have scored this challenge way higher than usual. I suspect I''ll move a couple more to 10 soon, but this one really stands out for me.</td>', 'This is a killer nice rendering in B/W that lets me FEEL the colors fading.  Well done. I have finished my second pass, this is my only 10 thus far, though on average I have scored this challenge way higher than usual. I suspect I''ll move a couple more to 10 soon, but this one really stands out for me.', '2009-07-15 12:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
