(5575312, 806858, 45793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-07-15 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575335, 806718, 102019, '<td valign="top">This photo got a very high mark from me.  I think the only thing that would have made this a better photo for me would have been in the framing.  I find it a bit too symetrical and static -- My eyes are drawn to the center of the photo, but then there is very little movement drawing my eyes away from the middle.</td>', 'This photo got a very high mark from me.  I think the only thing that would have made this a better photo for me would have been in the framing.  I find it a bit too symetrical and static -- My eyes are drawn to the center of the photo, but then there is very little movement drawing my eyes away from the middle.', '2009-07-15 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575336, 806801, 102019, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before.  And the one I''ve seen before was much more interesting than this one.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before.  And the one I''ve seen before was much more interesting than this one.', '2009-07-15 17:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575338, 805523, 102019, '<td valign="top">A bit too busy for me -- there''s too much going on here.  Less is more!</td>', 'A bit too busy for me -- there''s too much going on here.  Less is more!', '2009-07-15 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575354, 806195, 102019, '<td valign="top">Being this close to a daisy, I would have expected to see more details in the petals than is shown here -- the tips of the petals around the edges look a little soft.  Perhaps that was your intent -- but it''s not my preference.  For this to get a higher mark from me it would need more sharpness.  I do like the framing, however.  I think the way you cropped the photo works quite well.</td>', 'Being this close to a daisy, I would have expected to see more details in the petals than is shown here -- the tips of the petals around the edges look a little soft.  Perhaps that was your intent -- but it''s not my preference.  For this to get a higher mark from me it would need more sharpness.  I do like the framing, however.  I think the way you cropped the photo works quite well.', '2009-07-15 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575357, 805570, 102019, '<td valign="top">I''m bothered by whatever that green thing is that''s coming across the flower.  It looks like it doesn''t belong.  I would have moved it away, then waited for another bee to come.</td>', 'I''m bothered by whatever that green thing is that''s coming across the flower.  It looks like it doesn''t belong.  I would have moved it away, then waited for another bee to come.', '2009-07-15 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575362, 806770, 102019, '<td valign="top">The background is not uniform enough for my tastes -- I think something in the background that adds more contrast to the petals would have worked well -- a darker colour.  I find the red/pink hues in the background distracting and they are drawing my eyes away from your focal point.</td>', 'The background is not uniform enough for my tastes -- I think something in the background that adds more contrast to the petals would have worked well -- a darker colour.  I find the red/pink hues in the background distracting and they are drawing my eyes away from your focal point.', '2009-07-15 17:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575363, 806409, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a little busy -- I don''t see a clear focal point.  My eyes are wandering aimlessly around the photo with nothing in particular of interest to draw them in.</td>', 'It''s a little busy -- I don''t see a clear focal point.  My eyes are wandering aimlessly around the photo with nothing in particular of interest to draw them in.', '2009-07-15 17:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575369, 806694, 102019, '<td valign="top">You have two distinct focal points in this shot -- the anchor, and the chain, and my eyes are torn between the two.  I''m not sure which one to look at.  It''s kind of an odd framing.  For me it would have worked best if one had been eliminated from the frame so that my full attention could be focused on the other.</td>', 'You have two distinct focal points in this shot -- the anchor, and the chain, and my eyes are torn between the two.  I''m not sure which one to look at.  It''s kind of an odd framing.  For me it would have worked best if one had been eliminated from the frame so that my full attention could be focused on the other.', '2009-07-15 17:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575371, 806768, 102019, '<td valign="top">I like it... its just a tad too dark  for me.</td>', 'I like it... its just a tad too dark  for me.', '2009-07-15 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575374, 806870, 102019, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t immediately make me think of a flower... I see something else entirely.  The title suits my twisted mind.</td>', 'It doesn''t immediately make me think of a flower... I see something else entirely.  The title suits my twisted mind.', '2009-07-15 18:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575377, 806741, 102019, '<td valign="top">I see the visitor -- very cool!  This photo gets a high mark from me.  My only criticism would be the tie on the stem.  Could you have moved it up higher so that it was out of the shot and tucked behind the white petal?  I found it distracting.</td>', 'I see the visitor -- very cool!  This photo gets a high mark from me.  My only criticism would be the tie on the stem.  Could you have moved it up higher so that it was out of the shot and tucked behind the white petal?  I found it distracting.', '2009-07-15 18:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575379, 806256, 102019, '<td valign="top">strange colours on the stem... it doesn''t look natural.</td>', 'strange colours on the stem... it doesn''t look natural.', '2009-07-15 18:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575400, 806739, 102019, '<td valign="top">The colours don''t look natural to me... I also don''t like those two sharp lines of the petals that are in focus.  It seems out of place.</td>', 'The colours don''t look natural to me... I also don''t like those two sharp lines of the petals that are in focus.  It seems out of place.', '2009-07-15 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5575413, 805898, 102019, '<td valign="top">You''re right... it''s not artwork.  It''s not my taste at all.</td>', 'You''re right... it''s not artwork.  It''s not my taste at all.', '2009-07-15 18:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
