(5579052, 806616, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh very nice!!!<br/> <br/>Back to guess who took this photo, could it be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a>?</td>', 'Oh very nice!!! Back to guess who took this photo, could it be  timfythetoo?', '2009-07-19 09:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
