(5579460, 806409, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more light on the rearmost inflorescence to more closely match those in front, and make it stand out from the background.</td>', 'I wish there was more light on the rearmost inflorescence to more closely match those in front, and make it stand out from the background.', '2009-07-19 19:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579463, 806900, 1031, '<td valign="top">The outline looks like a Stegosaurus shuffling off into the distance. :-)</td>', 'The outline looks like a Stegosaurus shuffling off into the distance. :-)', '2009-07-19 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579544, 806295, 32011, '<td valign="top">This in out-and-out the best image of the challenge IMO.  Love everything about it... composition brilliant, sharpness might be a little soft in the centre of the flower... and its very different from all the others in the challenge, which gets major browny points in my book... will probably ribbon, and will not be surprised if it wins a posthumous or something similar too.</td>', 'This in out-and-out the best image of the challenge IMO.  Love everything about it... composition brilliant, sharpness might be a little soft in the centre of the flower... and its very different from all the others in the challenge, which gets major browny points in my book... will probably ribbon, and will not be surprised if it wins a posthumous or something similar too.', '2009-07-19 21:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579545, 806709, 32011, '<td valign="top">Wow... this is unique... in a good way!  I absolutely love this image, though I don''t understand the title... I haven''t let that effect my voting (which I did earlier).  Kudos for doing something so different... I was dreading voting on this challenge, and it was images such as this and a handful of other that made it quite enjoyable... this was one of the cherries in the pacman maze that the flowers challenge was.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow... this is unique... in a good way!  I absolutely love this image, though I don''t understand the title... I haven''t let that effect my voting (which I did earlier).  Kudos for doing something so different... I was dreading voting on this challenge, and it was images such as this and a handful of other that made it quite enjoyable... this was one of the cherries in the pacman maze that the flowers challenge was.  Well done!', '2009-07-19 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579546, 806613, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is a great image... I love the detail, and the feeling of flames... a cauldron perhaps. Colours and and composition is excellent... reckon it''s at least a top 10 finisher.</td>', 'This is a great image... I love the detail, and the feeling of flames... a cauldron perhaps. Colours and and composition is excellent... reckon it''s at least a top 10 finisher.', '2009-07-19 21:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579548, 806830, 32011, '<td valign="top">A posthumous (or similar) winner, without a doubt... and, I having a similar appreciation for things a little different, think this is one of the best images in the challenge... though, I''m at pains to say, I think the average voter just won''t get this... I hope to God I''m wrong, and would LOVE to see this do well.  It''s sharp, yet soft... there''s colour, but not too much... it''s composed brilliantly, but not traditionally.  It''s a work of art.  Really.  Think I have to fav this after writing this comment.</td>', 'A posthumous (or similar) winner, without a doubt... and, I having a similar appreciation for things a little different, think this is one of the best images in the challenge... though, I''m at pains to say, I think the average voter just won''t get this... I hope to God I''m wrong, and would LOVE to see this do well.  It''s sharp, yet soft... there''s colour, but not too much... it''s composed brilliantly, but not traditionally.  It''s a work of art.  Really.  Think I have to fav this after writing this comment.', '2009-07-19 21:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579550, 806890, 32011, '<td valign="top">Oh... this is nice.  So soft and inviting... I can feel the texture of the petals... and the selective desat... BRILLIANT touch.  Detail and composition - WOW!!!!  Probable ribbon in a very strong field... if you don''t ribbon, you''ve been robbed.</td>', 'Oh... this is nice.  So soft and inviting... I can feel the texture of the petals... and the selective desat... BRILLIANT touch.  Detail and composition - WOW!!!!  Probable ribbon in a very strong field... if you don''t ribbon, you''ve been robbed.', '2009-07-19 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579551, 806389, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  Love the processing (contrast is spot on) and the composition is perfect.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  Love the processing (contrast is spot on) and the composition is perfect.', '2009-07-19 21:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579552, 806801, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''m not generally a fan of the water drop shots (been done to death... so cliche) but you''ve executed it so perfectly that I had to rate this up there with my favourites in this challenge.  Composition is different enough to carry the water drop cliche... which is an outstanding effort.  Well done.</td>', 'I''m not generally a fan of the water drop shots (been done to death... so cliche) but you''ve executed it so perfectly that I had to rate this up there with my favourites in this challenge.  Composition is different enough to carry the water drop cliche... which is an outstanding effort.  Well done.', '2009-07-19 21:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579554, 806728, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful... and I love that you''ve composed this in an unorthodox way...  but not only is it different, it''s sharp... and the minimalism of it REALLY appeals to me... white flowers on a white background... never thought it would work, but you''ve nailed it!</td>', 'This is simply beautiful... and I love that you''ve composed this in an unorthodox way...  but not only is it different, it''s sharp... and the minimalism of it REALLY appeals to me... white flowers on a white background... never thought it would work, but you''ve nailed it!', '2009-07-19 21:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579557, 806403, 42100, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge description to a tee...unique and creative!  Very dreamy with the LB and light.</td>', 'This fits the challenge description to a tee...unique and creative!  Very dreamy with the LB and light.', '2009-07-19 21:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579559, 806686, 66515, '<td valign="top">interesting border.  I like how the blossoms are nicely backlit</td>', 'interesting border.  I like how the blossoms are nicely backlit', '2009-07-19 21:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579560, 806895, 42100, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous wedding candid.  If I were wedding couple, I would be very proud to have this as part of the set.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous wedding candid.  If I were wedding couple, I would be very proud to have this as part of the set.', '2009-07-19 21:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579561, 806728, 66515, '<td valign="top">wow....great exposure on this. I always find it hard to expose white objects on white backgrounds.</td>', 'wow....great exposure on this. I always find it hard to expose white objects on white backgrounds.', '2009-07-19 21:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579562, 805955, 42100, '<td valign="top">Brilliant in color, texture and detail.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Brilliant in color, texture and detail.  Very nicely done!', '2009-07-19 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579565, 806237, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and graceful...nicely done on the shallow DoF!</td>', 'Very delicate and graceful...nicely done on the shallow DoF!', '2009-07-19 21:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579567, 806724, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nicely done with the watering can and pruning shears...very complimentary for this still life!</td>', 'Nicely done with the watering can and pruning shears...very complimentary for this still life!', '2009-07-19 21:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579569, 806738, 42100, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, gorgeous textures and tones...very nice work with the lens-baby!</td>', 'Gorgeous, gorgeous textures and tones...very nice work with the lens-baby!', '2009-07-19 21:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579579, 805523, 81530, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=56744" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">De Sousa</a> because of the background. Great shot.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is  De Sousa because of the background. Great shot.', '2009-07-19 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579595, 806880, 24486, '<td valign="top">The Winter Gardens. I really like the colour saturation &amp; the down low perspctive. I actually thought about going to the Winter Gardens myself for this challenge but never made it.</td>', 'The Winter Gardens. I really like the colour saturation & the down low perspctive. I actually thought about going to the Winter Gardens myself for this challenge but never made it.', '2009-07-19 22:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579596, 806724, 65234, '<td valign="top">Artfully arranged and perfectly lit.  The backdrop echoes the oxidation on the watering can nicely.  Nothing is perfect or shiny or "popping" and that''s as it should be; this image invites exploration and appreciation.  Easily my favorite in the challenge :-).<br/> <br/>Reminds me of some of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=79602" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AJHopp</a>''s floral still lifes (and that is a compliment ''cuz I love them!).</td>', 'Artfully arranged and perfectly lit.  The backdrop echoes the oxidation on the watering can nicely.  Nothing is perfect or shiny or "popping" and that''s as it should be; this image invites exploration and appreciation.  Easily my favorite in the challenge :-). Reminds me of some of  AJHopp''s floral still lifes (and that is a compliment ''cuz I love them!).', '2009-07-19 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579597, 805874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion here!  The flowers are posed perfectly and the fact that they are aging, and not completely dead, is quite poignant.</td>', 'Love the emotion here!  The flowers are posed perfectly and the fact that they are aging, and not completely dead, is quite poignant.', '2009-07-19 22:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579598, 805999, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfectly sharp and crisp throughout with nice color.  The browns are especially rich.  Lighting is very nice, too.  Well, heck, technicals are just outstanding, period!</td>', 'Perfectly sharp and crisp throughout with nice color.  The browns are especially rich.  Lighting is very nice, too.  Well, heck, technicals are just outstanding, period!', '2009-07-19 22:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579599, 806370, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very well seen!  Had to smile when I saw the title.  Really an interesting shot and wonderfully creative idea.</td>', 'Very well seen!  Had to smile when I saw the title.  Really an interesting shot and wonderfully creative idea.', '2009-07-19 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579600, 806745, 65234, '<td valign="top">:-(((  It doesn''t look happy about the rain.  Love that the background shows me rain in slo-mo, with occasional drops spitting off to one side or another.</td>', ':-(((  It doesn''t look happy about the rain.  Love that the background shows me rain in slo-mo, with occasional drops spitting off to one side or another.', '2009-07-19 22:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579601, 806622, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and DOF, I like the butterfly, I like the light bokeh behind him, I <i>love</i> the wispy spider webs under the flower :-)  That butterfly is lucky it wasn''t a much bigger spider or he''d be lunch!</td>', 'I like the colors and DOF, I like the butterfly, I like the light bokeh behind him, I love the wispy spider webs under the flower :-)  That butterfly is lucky it wasn''t a much bigger spider or he''d be lunch!', '2009-07-19 22:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579602, 806530, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the anthropomorphic idea of the bent flowers looking curiously at the one starting to bloom, wondering what it portends for them.</td>', 'Like the anthropomorphic idea of the bent flowers looking curiously at the one starting to bloom, wondering what it portends for them.', '2009-07-19 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579603, 806610, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice, soft swirls and a single teardrop.  Like the light and subdued hue.</td>', 'Nice, soft swirls and a single teardrop.  Like the light and subdued hue.', '2009-07-19 22:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579604, 805955, 65234, '<td valign="top">Butterfly weed :-)  Excellent sharpness on the bee; seems a little less so on the flower but that doesn''t bother me too much.  Like the colors and composition; overall, very nice.</td>', 'Butterfly weed :-)  Excellent sharpness on the bee; seems a little less so on the flower but that doesn''t bother me too much.  Like the colors and composition; overall, very nice.', '2009-07-19 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579605, 806108, 65234, '<td valign="top">Does look a bit wild and crazy ;-)  That fly better be holding on tight!  I like the sense of movement in the background shapes, like the flower was dancing.</td>', 'Does look a bit wild and crazy ;-)  That fly better be holding on tight!  I like the sense of movement in the background shapes, like the flower was dancing.', '2009-07-19 22:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579606, 806718, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very original (IMO)!  Interesting perspective and some fun shapes made by the petals and reflections.  If I had room I might have kept more water in the crop ... just seems too smack in the middle vertically for an asymmetrical subject.</td>', 'Very original (IMO)!  Interesting perspective and some fun shapes made by the petals and reflections.  If I had room I might have kept more water in the crop ... just seems too smack in the middle vertically for an asymmetrical subject.', '2009-07-19 22:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579607, 806738, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2009-07-19 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579608, 806817, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very intense!  Just the right angle and contrast to make that inner daylily positively burn.</td>', 'Very intense!  Just the right angle and contrast to make that inner daylily positively burn.', '2009-07-19 22:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579609, 806858, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and the background is beautiful.</td>', 'Lovely light and the background is beautiful.', '2009-07-19 22:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579612, 806894, 65234, '<td valign="top">YAY; one of my favorite little flowers :-)  Nicely captured.</td>', 'YAY; one of my favorite little flowers :-)  Nicely captured.', '2009-07-19 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579613, 806882, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost a glow-in-the-dark effect with that vivid flower. Like the negatve space ... might even like a touch more on top.</td>', 'Almost a glow-in-the-dark effect with that vivid flower. Like the negatve space ... might even like a touch more on top.', '2009-07-19 22:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579615, 806844, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very much like the lines in the background; makes an intriguing setting for the flower.  Think I would have cropped just a tiny bit tighter at the top so the diagonal there ran right out of the frame.</td>', 'Very much like the lines in the background; makes an intriguing setting for the flower.  Think I would have cropped just a tiny bit tighter at the top so the diagonal there ran right out of the frame.', '2009-07-19 22:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579617, 806897, 65234, '<td valign="top">Definitely creative :-)</td>', 'Definitely creative :-)', '2009-07-19 22:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579620, 806445, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  The drooping flowers are just sad, like he''s been carrying them around since he brought them to her doorstep and she told him she never wanted to see him again.</td>', 'Interesting!  The drooping flowers are just sad, like he''s been carrying them around since he brought them to her doorstep and she told him she never wanted to see him again.', '2009-07-19 22:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579629, 805999, 88136, '<td valign="top">looks like a painting its so perfect. gorgeous</td>', 'looks like a painting its so perfect. gorgeous', '2009-07-19 22:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579630, 806594, 88136, '<td valign="top">nice surreal feel</td>', 'nice surreal feel', '2009-07-19 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579633, 805068, 88136, '<td valign="top">i wish the table was straight rather then curved. i also find the lines in the background distracting.</td>', 'i wish the table was straight rather then curved. i also find the lines in the background distracting.', '2009-07-19 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579634, 806290, 88136, '<td valign="top">lovely abstract</td>', 'lovely abstract', '2009-07-19 22:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579636, 805180, 88136, '<td valign="top">very pretty. reminds me of a creamsicle</td>', 'very pretty. reminds me of a creamsicle', '2009-07-19 22:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579655, 806035, 67697, '<td valign="top">Good luck!  Good luck!  I hope this does well for you  :)</td>', 'Good luck!  Good luck!  I hope this does well for you  :)', '2009-07-19 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579671, 806728, 75713, '<td valign="top">I first gave you a 7 for this photo ...... I would like to see even more definition in the flowers ... I feel that this photo has hidden treasures/treats/beauty almost rendered invisable with your processing... this photo has the potential to be Zen ........ to be Peace  ... to be so much more than what you have offerred.   Coming back to revisit this photo and revise my opinion .. I am upping the score to an 8 and want to add that individual monitors make a huge difference and what looks washed out to me might be spot on to you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-20 00:56:02.</i></td>', 'I first gave you a 7 for this photo ...... I would like to see even more definition in the flowers ... I feel that this photo has hidden treasures/treats/beauty almost rendered invisable with your processing... this photo has the potential to be Zen ........ to be Peace  ... to be so much more than what you have offerred.   Coming back to revisit this photo and revise my opinion .. I am upping the score to an 8 and want to add that individual monitors make a huge difference and what looks washed out to me might be spot on to you.', '2009-07-19 23:32:57.000000', '2009-07-20 01:56:02.000000', 1),
(5579715, 806591, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very nice yet I would like to have seen a F32 exposure from afar to get a deeper DOF.... none the less very NICE!</td>', 'Very nice yet I would like to have seen a F32 exposure from afar to get a deeper DOF.... none the less very NICE!', '2009-07-20 00:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579716, 805852, 15407, '<td valign="top">Yes and the DOF made it difficult to get a better crop/composure.</td>', 'Yes and the DOF made it difficult to get a better crop/composure.', '2009-07-20 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579717, 806745, 15407, '<td valign="top">-1 for phoney water</td>', '-1 for phoney water', '2009-07-20 00:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579719, 806414, 15407, '<td valign="top">Too Soft wonderful composure though!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-22 07:02:37.</i></td>', 'Too Soft wonderful composure though!', '2009-07-20 00:28:41.000000', '2009-07-22 08:02:37.000000', 1),
(5579721, 806871, 15407, '<td valign="top">So nice and (too sharp) for me -1</td>', 'So nice and (too sharp) for me -1', '2009-07-20 00:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5579726, 806734, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very nice yet to much of a repaeating theme, perhaps a shot croped y 75% would have given this a real POP!</td>', 'Very nice yet to much of a repaeating theme, perhaps a shot croped y 75% would have given this a real POP!', '2009-07-20 00:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
