(5579765, 806724, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is maybe an AJHopp photo? (or it at least looks like one) The dark tones and careful arrangement of items make me think this.  Beautiful scene :)</td>', 'I''m guessing this is maybe an AJHopp photo? (or it at least looks like one) The dark tones and careful arrangement of items make me think this.  Beautiful scene :)', '2009-07-20 00:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
