(5579767, 806734, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how this scene is sprinkled with such beautiful color.  There''s almost a 3-d feel to this photo.</td>', 'I love how this scene is sprinkled with such beautiful color.  There''s almost a 3-d feel to this photo.', '2009-07-20 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
