(5579781, 806535, 96881, '<td valign="top">For a guy that says he can''t do Flower shots.........<br/> <br/>Congrats Tony</td>', 'For a guy that says he can''t do Flower shots......... Congrats Tony', '2009-07-20 01:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
