(5580166, 805297, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent technique here Karen.  I am sorry I only gave you a 7 for this - i should have voted it higher but I am growing a bit jaded with the ''objects in droplets'' shots - one of those effects of being around here a while.  I need to remember that all these shots should be taken at face value and vote accordingly.  However, this one is awesome and you have done this approach very well.  The colors are rich and not overdone, the details delightful, and the multiple drops is just an added bonus.  Good work.</td>', 'Excellent technique here Karen.  I am sorry I only gave you a 7 for this - i should have voted it higher but I am growing a bit jaded with the ''objects in droplets'' shots - one of those effects of being around here a while.  I need to remember that all these shots should be taken at face value and vote accordingly.  However, this one is awesome and you have done this approach very well.  The colors are rich and not overdone, the details delightful, and the multiple drops is just an added bonus.  Good work.', '2009-07-20 08:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
