(5580219, 806512, 24454, '<td valign="top">Roz, this is beautiful!  I like what MsAmbrosia said about it making a beautiful wedding shot.  I''ve had weddings on my mind a bit lately, so that''s almost exactly what I was thinking -- how much a bride would love this picture if it was part of her wedding album.  Elle is so beautiful, and this has such a soft dreamy look, without being high key.  I think you did an excellent job, and I''m disappointed that it didn''t get a better score.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Roz, this is beautiful!  I like what MsAmbrosia said about it making a beautiful wedding shot.  I''ve had weddings on my mind a bit lately, so that''s almost exactly what I was thinking -- how much a bride would love this picture if it was part of her wedding album.  Elle is so beautiful, and this has such a soft dreamy look, without being high key.  I think you did an excellent job, and I''m disappointed that it didn''t get a better score. ', '2009-07-20 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
