(5580253, 806866, 8367, '<td valign="top">I agree with the previous comments, nice colors and lighting.<br/>I rated this a 7. I think the comp may have hurt the score.<br/>It <i>is</i> very interesting, but not quite balanced enough, imho.<br/>I think the rocks overpower the image...just a hint at the bottom would be enough to anchor the image. I tried a different crop (it''s a little tighter than what I wanted...<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=808380" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8367/120/808380.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8367/120/808380.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8367/120/808380.jpg"/></a>. and it''s just cut and pasted onto a black background. I lost the beautiful lighting on the right side by doing that, but I hope you get the idea.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-20 09:02:11.</i></td>', 'I agree with the previous comments, nice colors and lighting.I rated this a 7. I think the comp may have hurt the score.It is very interesting, but not quite balanced enough, imho.I think the rocks overpower the image...just a hint at the bottom would be enough to anchor the image. I tried a different crop (it''s a little tighter than what I wanted.... and it''s just cut and pasted onto a black background. I lost the beautiful lighting on the right side by doing that, but I hope you get the idea.', '2009-07-20 09:53:06.000000', '2009-07-20 10:02:11.000000', 0),
(5580254, 806514, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygosh!  What were the voters thinking?????  This is AMAZING!  I''ve often thought how risky it is to even remotely think outside the box or present a slightly different take on a topic.  Its disappointing!  But a 5.9 on a photo like this confirms my understanding of how the voting goes here.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygosh!  What were the voters thinking?????  This is AMAZING!  I''ve often thought how risky it is to even remotely think outside the box or present a slightly different take on a topic.  Its disappointing!  But a 5.9 on a photo like this confirms my understanding of how the voting goes here. ', '2009-07-20 09:53:59.000000', NULL, 0),
