(5580300, 806403, 42100, '<td valign="top">It''s okay to not like a photo, and it''s okay to say why.  But why is it acceptable to be a complete ass about it?<br/> <br/>I''m sure if Rachel ever takes a photograph for the small minded, it''ll be a hit with kivgaen!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Chinarosepetal:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi, I really liked this image and voted accordingly, I''m sorry that you were upset by that comment, but remember, it''s ok for people not to like your image and I am always interested to know why people don''t like an image, and you were given some good (mostly subjective) reasons there. I would have marked that comment as helpful ;) </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-20 09:32:21.</i></td>', 'It''s okay to not like a photo, and it''s okay to say why.  But why is it acceptable to be a complete ass about it? I''m sure if Rachel ever takes a photograph for the small minded, it''ll be a hit with kivgaen! Originally posted by Chinarosepetal: Hi, I really liked this image and voted accordingly, I''m sorry that you were upset by that comment, but remember, it''s ok for people not to like your image and I am always interested to know why people don''t like an image, and you were given some good (mostly subjective) reasons there. I would have marked that comment as helpful ;) ', '2009-07-20 10:21:09.000000', '2009-07-20 10:32:21.000000', 0),
