(5581316, 805365, 17851, '<td valign="top">cool shot =)..that was one of my favorite shows, too bad they cancelled it :/</td>', 'cool shot =)..that was one of my favorite shows, too bad they cancelled it :/', '2009-07-21 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581351, 805915, 60195, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless.  I had this around 155 places higher in MY voting.  Shame.  <br/>Beautiful tones, lighting, and composition.</td>', 'I''m speechless.  I had this around 155 places higher in MY voting.  Shame.  Beautiful tones, lighting, and composition.', '2009-07-21 03:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581352, 805999, 30456, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon.  Superbly done.</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved ribbon.  Superbly done.', '2009-07-21 03:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581353, 806724, 30456, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon.  I like what you have done with the arrangment.  Lighting is perfecto!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon.  I like what you have done with the arrangment.  Lighting is perfecto!', '2009-07-21 03:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581355, 806535, 30456, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  Congratulations</td>', 'Sweet.  Congratulations', '2009-07-21 03:34:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581361, 806035, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very quiet, very lovely, and really nice to see you in a challenge!  This suits my eye as I tend to prefer right to left, which is not what folks normally expect.</td>', 'Very quiet, very lovely, and really nice to see you in a challenge!  This suits my eye as I tend to prefer right to left, which is not what folks normally expect.', '2009-07-21 04:02:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581363, 806754, 30982, '<td valign="top">Brian, this is gorgeous and vibrant!!  Love the bold color - and you exposed it perfectly (it''s so easy to oversaturate colors like this).  The detail is excellent, which is good because it''s a fascinating flower to explore.  The bug is delightful!  Who knew they came in that color?  Really well done - in my opinion, it really should have scored higher, too.</td>', 'Brian, this is gorgeous and vibrant!!  Love the bold color - and you exposed it perfectly (it''s so easy to oversaturate colors like this).  The detail is excellent, which is good because it''s a fascinating flower to explore.  The bug is delightful!  Who knew they came in that color?  Really well done - in my opinion, it really should have scored higher, too.', '2009-07-21 04:04:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581364, 806179, 30982, '<td valign="top">You may hate shooting flowers, but I like what you did with this one!</td>', 'You may hate shooting flowers, but I like what you did with this one!', '2009-07-21 04:06:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581366, 806370, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfection.  And what Steve said.</td>', 'Perfection.  And what Steve said.', '2009-07-21 04:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581368, 806369, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really pretty and well photographed.  This shows off how nicely Mother Nature does at combining colors sometimes - one wouldn''t normally put pink with orange, but it works so very well here.  Gorgeous light for this, too.</td>', 'Really pretty and well photographed.  This shows off how nicely Mother Nature does at combining colors sometimes - one wouldn''t normally put pink with orange, but it works so very well here.  Gorgeous light for this, too.', '2009-07-21 04:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581369, 806627, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bold, beautiful color in this and very striking against the dark background.  A touch more crispness/focus would really make this pop.  I see some don''t like the centered comp - I think it can work, especially with flowers.  Maybe more of a square crop to emphasize the centeredness, too.</td>', 'Bold, beautiful color in this and very striking against the dark background.  A touch more crispness/focus would really make this pop.  I see some don''t like the centered comp - I think it can work, especially with flowers.  Maybe more of a square crop to emphasize the centeredness, too.', '2009-07-21 04:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581371, 805908, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love old-fashioned roses - these with the single layer of petals.  Good composition with the green supporting the layer of pink.  Light may have been a bit strong - an overcast day or light a bit lower would show off the color and detail better.  Still, I like thise flowers - nice to see them in the challenge.</td>', 'I love old-fashioned roses - these with the single layer of petals.  Good composition with the green supporting the layer of pink.  Light may have been a bit strong - an overcast day or light a bit lower would show off the color and detail better.  Still, I like thise flowers - nice to see them in the challenge.', '2009-07-21 04:15:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581381, 806641, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of light to show off the color and delicate nature of this flower.  Good solid composition, and I see you have the DPC water drops!  :-)</td>', 'Really nice use of light to show off the color and delicate nature of this flower.  Good solid composition, and I see you have the DPC water drops!  :-)', '2009-07-21 04:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581382, 806385, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would have never guessed you did this with lighting - VERY clever!  I very much do like the result.  Sunflowers to me as very cheerful flowers, and the "electric" nature of your light trails combined with the smoothness of the processing really amps up the "cheerful" level of this - very warm, very delightful, and very clever indeed!</td>', 'I would have never guessed you did this with lighting - VERY clever!  I very much do like the result.  Sunflowers to me as very cheerful flowers, and the "electric" nature of your light trails combined with the smoothness of the processing really amps up the "cheerful" level of this - very warm, very delightful, and very clever indeed!', '2009-07-21 04:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581386, 806856, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like the different setting for this.  My only suggestion would be to have included a bit more of the vase for context.</td>', 'I very much like the different setting for this.  My only suggestion would be to have included a bit more of the vase for context.', '2009-07-21 04:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581387, 806820, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats to Karen, and thanks for sharing her poem with the rest of us.  The two photos make a wonderful pair.<br/> <br/>Holy crap.  I just looked at the score.  That is beyond the usual "wrongness" that DPC can serve up.  Seriously, that really irritates me.</td>', 'Congrats to Karen, and thanks for sharing her poem with the rest of us.  The two photos make a wonderful pair. Holy crap.  I just looked at the score.  That is beyond the usual "wrongness" that DPC can serve up.  Seriously, that really irritates me.', '2009-07-21 04:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581389, 805180, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll say you broke your run of 5''s!  Congrats on the new addition to your Top 5, too!</td>', 'I''ll say you broke your run of 5''s!  Congrats on the new addition to your Top 5, too!', '2009-07-21 04:39:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581390, 806858, 30982, '<td valign="top">Did I mention the nifty title?  Really gorgeous, particularly that nifty bit of purplish on the stem.  You really do justice to that lens - it likes you, methinks.</td>', 'Did I mention the nifty title?  Really gorgeous, particularly that nifty bit of purplish on the stem.  You really do justice to that lens - it likes you, methinks.', '2009-07-21 04:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581392, 806881, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gentle and quiet - very effective and a very good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Gentle and quiet - very effective and a very good entry for this challenge.', '2009-07-21 04:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581393, 806050, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this, Rosemary - to me it''s a very gentle view of what is normally considered a very bold flower, and you did an AWESOME job with the processing!  You added richness and warmth to what was kind sterile, and I really like the way you brought out the subtle gradation of light.  Excellent job of "seeing" what was there and making it happen.  Congrats on the new entry in your top row, too!!</td>', 'I really like this, Rosemary - to me it''s a very gentle view of what is normally considered a very bold flower, and you did an AWESOME job with the processing!  You added richness and warmth to what was kind sterile, and I really like the way you brought out the subtle gradation of light.  Excellent job of "seeing" what was there and making it happen.  Congrats on the new entry in your top row, too!!', '2009-07-21 04:45:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581404, 806404, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely shallow DOF and very nice placement and use of the highly recommended water drops!  :-)  Colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'Lovely shallow DOF and very nice placement and use of the highly recommended water drops!  :-)  Colors are gorgeous.', '2009-07-21 06:09:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581405, 806838, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this for the naturalness of it.  While your title (and the barbed wire) indicate a caged situation, it doesn''t feel that way to me - has a nice peacefulness and harmony to it.  A kind of "flourish where you are" message if you will.  Quite lovely.</td>', 'I really like this for the naturalness of it.  While your title (and the barbed wire) indicate a caged situation, it doesn''t feel that way to me - has a nice peacefulness and harmony to it.  A kind of "flourish where you are" message if you will.  Quite lovely.', '2009-07-21 06:11:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581406, 806639, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good detail and a very intriguing flower!  As an added bonus, you''ve got the flying insect coming in for a landing (great title, by the way.)  While I appreciate some of the perfectly lit studio setups, I very enjoy the more natural captures like this one - flowers as we see them.</td>', 'Very good detail and a very intriguing flower!  As an added bonus, you''ve got the flying insect coming in for a landing (great title, by the way.)  While I appreciate some of the perfectly lit studio setups, I very enjoy the more natural captures like this one - flowers as we see them.', '2009-07-21 06:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581408, 806183, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really lovely, Robert.</td>', 'Really lovely, Robert.', '2009-07-21 06:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581409, 806614, 30982, '<td valign="top">I truly expected this much higher - beautiful capture.</td>', 'I truly expected this much higher - beautiful capture.', '2009-07-21 06:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581410, 806698, 30982, '<td valign="top">I recall this one from voting very clearly - it is so delightfully fresh, so upbeat, so full-of-promise morning new, if that makes sense.  You captured the light brilliantly (pun intended!) and the supporting bokeh is perfect.  Beautifully done!</td>', 'I recall this one from voting very clearly - it is so delightfully fresh, so upbeat, so full-of-promise morning new, if that makes sense.  You captured the light brilliantly (pun intended!) and the supporting bokeh is perfect.  Beautifully done!', '2009-07-21 06:26:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581411, 806243, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very gentle yet pervasive, those morning glories.  I like the use here - the old monument with the new growth and the quiet flowers.  And the light is just lovely in this.</td>', 'Very gentle yet pervasive, those morning glories.  I like the use here - the old monument with the new growth and the quiet flowers.  And the light is just lovely in this.', '2009-07-21 06:28:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581412, 806295, 30982, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous floral-as-geometric-abstract.  Amazing tones, textures, and I love the ever-so-gentle curves of white on white.</td>', 'A gorgeous floral-as-geometric-abstract.  Amazing tones, textures, and I love the ever-so-gentle curves of white on white.', '2009-07-21 06:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581413, 806628, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wise beyond her years, this one.</td>', 'Wise beyond her years, this one.', '2009-07-21 06:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581414, 806108, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, there''s the quiet little surprise of the winged visitor!  Exceptional detail, good use of DOF, and I really like the more unusual subject.  The bokeh behind is perfect to set off the wispy nature of your subject.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Ah, there''s the quiet little surprise of the winged visitor!  Exceptional detail, good use of DOF, and I really like the more unusual subject.  The bokeh behind is perfect to set off the wispy nature of your subject.  Nicely done!', '2009-07-21 06:33:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581416, 806025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes I play "guess the score" and I was WAY off on this one - I figured 6.1-6.3.  I have no idea why it scored where it did.  Beautiful light, excellent detail.  Really very lovely!</td>', 'Sometimes I play "guess the score" and I was WAY off on this one - I figured 6.1-6.3.  I have no idea why it scored where it did.  Beautiful light, excellent detail.  Really very lovely!', '2009-07-21 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581424, 806610, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  As good as Oliver''s and more creative!  :-)</td>', 'Beautifully done.  As good as Oliver''s and more creative!  :-)', '2009-07-21 06:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581433, 805999, 77192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eyewave:</b></div><hr/><i>When this challenge came up, I looked through the challenge archives and noticed that I won the blue in "Flora III". </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think you''ve got far too many ribbons if you have to check online which challenges you got them for ;-) Just kidding, congratulations on this one. Great shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by eyewave:When this challenge came up, I looked through the challenge archives and noticed that I won the blue in "Flora III".   I think you''ve got far too many ribbons if you have to check online which challenges you got them for ;-) Just kidding, congratulations on this one. Great shot.', '2009-07-21 07:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581436, 805999, 28742, '<td valign="top">Right on, Oliver! Congrats!</td>', 'Right on, Oliver! Congrats!', '2009-07-21 07:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5581438, 806613, 28742, '<td valign="top">I don''t like flowers much - BUT - this one looks like FIRE and I like fire! :) Great job!</td>', 'I don''t like flowers much - BUT - this one looks like FIRE and I like fire! :) Great job!', '2009-07-21 07:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
