(5581679, 806389, 100335, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 9 btw, i really liked it. I think its just its up against some great competition. Well done though.</td>', 'I gave this one a 9 btw, i really liked it. I think its just its up against some great competition. Well done though.', '2009-07-21 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
