(5582480, 806641, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>Susan, me again!<br/> <br/>Well done on a good score in a tough challenge. <br/> <br/>Great composition, good choice of subject and I like the white background.  The lighting is also rather good and accentuates the colour of the flower well.<br/> <br/>I think you could have tipped over to a 6 if the background was a little whiter.  The top right quadrant is a little grey and I think this probably cost you a point or two.  Also, the flower seems a little bit soft to me.  I have that lens too and find at the longer focal lengths it is really quite soft.<br/> <br/>All in all though this is a nice one.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club Susan, me again! Well done on a good score in a tough challenge.  Great composition, good choice of subject and I like the white background.  The lighting is also rather good and accentuates the colour of the flower well. I think you could have tipped over to a 6 if the background was a little whiter.  The top right quadrant is a little grey and I think this probably cost you a point or two.  Also, the flower seems a little bit soft to me.  I have that lens too and find at the longer focal lengths it is really quite soft. All in all though this is a nice one.', '2009-07-22 02:42:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5582540, 806880, 88136, '<td valign="top">Howdy from the Critique Club:)<br/>I enjoyed this photo in voting, lots of color and different lines make it pleasing to look at.  To tell you the truth i personally dont think ''flowers'' when i see it, since they are more of a fun extra that adds a new demension to the photo the a main event type thing. i am glad for you that it scored as well s it did because of that reason, since i am fond of out of the box stuff even if it does stretch a bit imo. nice lighitng and post processing too, i like the evening feel the lighting has</td>', 'Howdy from the Critique Club:)I enjoyed this photo in voting, lots of color and different lines make it pleasing to look at.  To tell you the truth i personally dont think ''flowers'' when i see it, since they are more of a fun extra that adds a new demension to the photo the a main event type thing. i am glad for you that it scored as well s it did because of that reason, since i am fond of out of the box stuff even if it does stretch a bit imo. nice lighitng and post processing too, i like the evening feel the lighting has', '2009-07-22 03:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
